#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:31
msgid ""
"Second vehicle. Nissan LEAF 30 kWh.\n"
"\n"
"The vehicle is also equipped with similar family of Ficosa Telematics "
"Control Units. Only difference is with supported network generations, "
"limited to 3 G.\n"
"\n"
"Learn more about them on Git Hub and Open Car Wings website."
msgstr ""
"Teine sõiduk. Nissan LEAF 30 kWh.\n"
"\n"
"Sõiduk on varustatud sarnase Ficosa telemaatikajuhtseadmete perekonnaga. "
"Ainus erinevus on toetatud võrgupõlvkondades, mis on piiratud 3G-ga.\n"
"\n"
"Lisateavet leiate GitHubist ja Open Car Wingsi veebisaidilt."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:568
msgid ""
"Use remote climate control or the timer so that the cabin will be at a "
"comfortable temperature before starting.  This allows the car to save energy "
"whilst being driven."
msgstr ""
"Kasutage kaugjuhtimisega kliimaseadet või taimerit, et salong oleks enne "
"käivitamist mugaval temperatuuril. See võimaldab autol sõidu ajal energiat "
"säästa."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:569
msgid ""
"Keep your car in the garage during winter times to keep the battery pack "
"warm.  This will increase your range a bit, especially in colder climates."
msgstr ""
"Hoidke autot talvel garaažis, et aku soojas püsiks. See suurendab veidi "
"sõiduulatust, eriti külmemas kliimas."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:570
msgid ""
"Use <phoneme alphabet=\"x-SVOX-sampa_en-GB\" ph=\"'i:-k@@U\">eco</phoneme> "
"mode or B-mode when possible to increase your regenerative energy."
msgstr ""
"Regeneratiivse energia suurendamiseks kasutage võimaluse korral ökorežiimi "
"või B-režiimi."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:571
msgid ""
"Check your tire pressure at least once a month to ensure they are at optimal "
"level.  Low tire pressure decreases rolling effect of the car and more "
"energy is used on propulsion."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollige rehvirõhku vähemalt kord kuus, et see oleks optimaalsel tasemel. "
"Madal rehvirõhk vähendab auto veeremisefekti ja liikumapanemiseks kulub "
"rohkem energiat."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:572
msgid ""
"Plan your routes to include charging stations, especially on longer trips, "
"to avoid range anxiety and ensure smooth travel."
msgstr ""
"Planeeri oma marsruudid nii, et need sisaldaksid laadimisjaamu, eriti "
"pikemate reiside puhul, et vältida sõiduulatuse pärast muretsemist ja tagada "
"sujuv sõit."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:573
msgid ""
"Avoid rapid acceleration and maintain a steady speed to maximize battery "
"efficiency, as aggressive driving can significantly reduce your range."
msgstr ""
"Väldi järsku kiirendamist ja hoia aku efektiivsuse maksimeerimiseks ühtlast "
"kiirust, kuna agressiivne sõitmine võib sõiduulatust oluliselt vähendada."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:574
msgid ""
"Use the Nissan Leaf’s navigation system to find the most energy-efficient "
"routes, which can help conserve battery power on unfamiliar roads."
msgstr ""
"Kasutage Nissan Leafi navigatsioonisüsteemi, et leida kõige "
"energiasäästlikumad marsruudid, mis aitavad tundmatutel teedel akut säästa."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:575
msgid ""
"In colder times, try to use more of seat heating and steering wheel heating "
"while keeping your air conditioning on lower settings. Auxiliary heating "
"elements consume less than car's air conditioning system."
msgstr ""
"Külmema ilmaga proovige kasutada rohkem istme- ja roolisoojendust, hoides "
"samal ajal kliimaseadme madalamal võimsusel. Lisakütteelemendid tarbivad "
"vähem energiat kui auto kliimaseade."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:576
msgid ""
"Park in shaded areas during hot weather to keep the battery cool, as extreme "
"heat can reduce battery efficiency and longevity."
msgstr ""
"Kuuma ilmaga parkige aku jahedana hoidmiseks varjulises kohas, kuna "
"äärmuslik kuumus võib vähendada aku efektiivsust ja eluiga."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:577
msgid ""
"Try to charge the battery up to 80 percent for daily usage. Charging to "
"full, every day, is not recommended for battery longevity."
msgstr ""
"Igapäevaseks kasutamiseks proovige akut laadida kuni 80 protsendini. Aku "
"pikaealisuse tagamiseks ei ole soovitatav iga päev täis laadida."

#: tculink/carwings_proto/autodj/opencarwings.py:578
msgid ""
"With Open Car Wings, you can review your driving efficiency of each trip, "
"online. With the data, it is easier to determine which areas of driving "
"needs to be improved to achieve supreme energy efficiency. "
msgstr ""
"Open Car Wingsi abil saate iga reisi sõidutõhusust veebis üle vaadata. "
"Andmete abil on lihtsam kindlaks teha, milliseid sõiduoskusi tuleb "
"tipptasemel energiatõhususe saavutamiseks parandada. "

