"You're done with providing necessary information to establish connection "
"with your LEAF."
msgstr "Oled lõpetanud vajaliku teabe esitamise, et luua ühendus oma LEAF-iga."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step5.html:9
msgid "You can now use TCU services."
msgstr "Nüüd saate kasutada kaugteenuseid."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step5.html:10
msgid ""
"Did you know? If you also change connection settings on your navigation "
"unit, you will get detailed vehicle statistic informations."
msgstr ""
"Kas teadsite? Kui muudate ka oma navigatsiooniseadme ühenduse seadeid, saate "
"üksikasjalikku teavet sõiduki statistika kohta."

